# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored, and a test fails the build if a key ever reaches a
# tracked file — a credential committed once stays in the history even if the file is deleted later.
#
# Create a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Only the run-time half of the benchmark needs a key at all; the static measurements
# (`uv run python -m bench.measure`) and the whole test suite run offline.
